## Setup {% #setup-otel-python %}

{% alert level="info" %}
OpenTelemetry is supported in the Python tracing library after version 1.12.0.
{% /alert %}

Set the `DD_TRACE_OTEL_ENABLED` environment variable to `true` to enable the OpenTelemetry API.

### Add custom span tags

```python
from opentelemetry import trace

span = trace.get_current_span()
span.set_attribute("user.name", "Some User")
```

A partial ends here.
